      "writtenOn": "2021-06-23T14:32:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, to different modules generating the \"same\" file is imaginable, especially with different variants, platform, system, product, etc... However, having two different modules contributing the same file to an apex should always be an error?\n\nBottom line, we cannot check for equality of builtFile,right? The above two builtFiles is what an error gives me if I change this if condition. Is that a bug?",
      "parentUuid": "c6375ea5_a5d33f3f",
      "revId": "756fb6afa2ba6a57b67ea78677acfb638f085b7f",
