      "message": "Right, I am with you on this now. I wasn\u0027t sure that linux_blic_x86_shared (without _apex suffix) was meant for the platform, or okay to be shared / it was common.\n\nOn a retry, I noticed that this is a problem with art host apex:\nerror: art/build/apex/Android.bp:384:1: module \"com.android.art.host\" variant \"linux_glibc_common_com.android.art.host_zip\": apex file lib64/libc++.so is provided by two different modules libc++{os:linux_glibc,arch:x86_64,link:shared,fuzzer:,apex:} and libc++{os:linux_glibc,arch:x86_64,link:shared,fuzzer:,apex:apex10000}\n\nIs that a bug? Should this be allowed?",
